00:03:27.677 --> 00:03:30.066
Dan, thank you so much for
picking up a copy of my book,

00:03:30.066 --> 00:03:33.090
Your One Word, I really,
really, really appreciate it,

00:03:33.090 --> 00:03:34.623
and I hope you're enjoying the read.

00:03:34.623 --> 00:03:36.200
So, thank you guys again for watching.

00:03:36.200 --> 00:03:37.362
I believe in you.

00:03:37.362 --> 00:03:39.268
I hope you continue to believe in yourself

00:03:39.268 --> 00:03:41.453
and whatever your one word is

00:03:41.453 --> 00:03:42.650
much love.

00:03:42.650 --> 00:03:43.750
I'll see you soon.

00:03:43.750 --> 00:03:45.833
